  {
   "id": "read-a-traceback",
   "title": {
    "en": "Reading an error without panic",
    "ar": "قراءة الخطأ بلا ذعر"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "🔍",
     "en": "Errors are clues, not failures",
     "ar": "الأخطاء أدلة، وليست فشلًا"
    },
    {
     "type": "anatomy",
     "parts": [
      {
       "text": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n",
       "color": "purple",
       "label": {
        "en": "error report starts",
        "ar": "بداية تقرير الخطأ"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "  File "
      },
      {
       "text": "\"C:\\code\\app.py\"",
       "color": "blue",
       "label": {
        "en": "which file",
        "ar": "أي ملف"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": ", "
      },
      {
       "text": "line 2",
       "color": "yellow",
       "label": {
        "en": "which line",
        "ar": "أي سطر"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": ", in <module>\n"
      },
      {
       "text": "    print(\"Age: \" + age)\n",
       "color": "cyan",
       "label": {
        "en": "the line itself",
        "ar": "السطر نفسه"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "TypeError",
       "color": "red",
       "label": {
        "en": "error type",
        "ar": "نوع الخطأ"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": ": "
      },
      {
       "text": "can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str",
       "color": "green",
       "label": {
        "en": "the message",
        "ar": "الرسالة"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "steps",
     "items": [
      {
       "en": "Read the LAST line first",
       "ar": "اقرأ السطر الأخير أولًا"
      },
      {
       "en": "Note the error type and message",
       "ar": "لاحظ نوع الخطأ ورسالته"
      },
      {
       "en": "Find the `line` number above it",
       "ar": "ابحث عن رقم السطر `line` فوقه"
      },
      {
       "en": "Open that line, fix, run again",
       "ar": "افتح ذلك السطر، أصلحه، شغّل مجددًا"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "text",
     "code": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\code\\greet.py\", line 4, in <module>\n    print(greet(5))\n  File \"C:\\code\\greet.py\", line 2, in greet\n    return \"Hi \" + name\nTypeError: can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str",
     "highlight": [
      4,
      6
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "en": "The bottom `File` is where Python stopped. The cause may sit higher, like `greet(5)` on line 4.",
     "ar": "آخر سطر `File` هو حيث توقف Python. وقد يكون السبب أعلى، مثل `greet(5)` في السطر 4."
    },
    {
     "type": "compare",
     "left": {
      "title": {
       "en": "Panic",
       "ar": "الذعر"
      },
      "tone": "bad",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "Red text means I failed",
        "ar": "النص الأحمر يعني أنني فشلت"
       },
       {
        "en": "Delete everything and restart",
        "ar": "أحذف كل شيء وأبدأ من جديد"
       }
      ]
     },
     "right": {
      "title": {
       "en": "Calm",
       "ar": "الهدوء"
      },
      "tone": "good",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "Read the bottom line first",
        "ar": "اقرأ السطر الأخير أولًا"
       },
       {
        "en": "Go to the line number",
        "ar": "اذهب إلى رقم السطر"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "common-errors",
   "title": {
    "en": "Five common errors and a habit",
    "ar": "خمسة أخطاء شائعة وعادة مفيدة"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "🩺",
     "en": "Five errors you will meet often",
     "ar": "خمسة أخطاء ستقابلها كثيرًا"
    },
    {
     "type": "cards",
     "items": [
      {
       "icon": "✏️",
       "color": "red",
       "title": {
        "en": "SyntaxError",
        "ar": "SyntaxError"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Missing `:` or bracket → add it where `^` points",
        "ar": "نقص `:` أو قوس ← أضفه حيث يشير `^`"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "❓",
       "color": "yellow",
       "title": {
        "en": "NameError",
        "ar": "NameError"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Typo or not created: `nmae` → spell `name`",
        "ar": "خطأ إملائي أو اسم غير موجود: `nmae` ← اكتب `name`"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "🧩",
       "color": "blue",
       "title": {
        "en": "TypeError",
        "ar": "TypeError"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "`\"Age: \" + 30` mixes types → use `str(30)`",
        "ar": "`\"Age: \" + 30` يخلط الأنواع ← استخدم `str(30)`"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "↔️",
       "color": "purple",
       "title": {
        "en": "IndentationError",
        "ar": "IndentationError"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Nothing indented after `if ...:` → add 4 spaces",
        "ar": "لا إزاحة بعد `if ...:` ← أضف 4 مسافات"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "🔑",
       "color": "cyan",
       "title": {
        "en": "KeyError",
        "ar": "KeyError"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Missing dict key `\"email\"` → check spelling or `.get()`",
        "ar": "المفتاح `\"email\"` غير موجود ← راجع الإملاء أو استخدم `.get()`"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "text",
     "code": "SyntaxError: expected ':'\nNameError: name 'nmae' is not defined\nTypeError: can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str\nIndentationError: expected an indented block after 'if' statement on line 2\nKeyError: 'email'"
    },
    {
     "type": "steps",
     "items": [
      {
       "en": "Print the value: `print(age)`",
       "ar": "اطبع القيمة: `print(age)`"
      },
      {
       "en": "Print its type: `type(age)`",
       "ar": "اطبع نوعها: `type(age)`"
      },
      {
       "en": "Compare with what you expected",
       "ar": "قارنها بما توقعته"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "python",
     "code": "import json\ndata = json.loads('{\"age\": \"30\"}')\nage = data[\"age\"]\nprint(age, type(age))   # 30 <class 'str'>\nprint(int(age) + 1)     # 31",
     "highlight": [
      4
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "en": "`\"30\"` in quotes is text, not a number. `print(x, type(x))` reveals it instantly.",
     "ar": "`\"30\"` بين علامتي تنصيص نص وليس رقمًا. و`print(x, type(x))` يكشف ذلك فورًا."
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "quiz": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "difficulty": "easy",
   "question": {
    "en": "Which line is valid JSON?",
    "ar": "أي سطر يُعد JSON صحيحًا؟"
   },
   "codeSnippet": "",
   "options": [
    {
     "en": "{'name': 'Sara'}",
     "ar": "{'name': 'Sara'}"
    },
    {
     "en": "{\"name\": \"Sara\"}",
     "ar": "{\"name\": \"Sara\"}"
    },
    {
     "en": "{name: \"Sara\"}",
     "ar": "{name: \"Sara\"}"
    },
    {
     "en": "{\"name\": 'Sara'}",
     "ar": "{\"name\": 'Sara'}"
    }
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "explanation": {
    "en": "JSON needs double quotes around every key and every string.",
    "ar": "يحتاج JSON إلى علامات تنصيص مزدوجة حول كل مفتاح وكل نص."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "difficulty": "easy",
   "question": {
    "en": "When Python reads JSON, what does `null` become?",
    "ar": "عندما يقرأ Python نص JSON، إلى ماذا تتحول `null`؟"
   },
   "codeSnippet": "",
   "options": [
    {
     "en": "0",
     "ar": "0"
    },
    {
     "en": "False",
     "ar": "False"
    },
    {
     "en": "None",
     "ar": "None"
